---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title="About & license" editPath="src/pages/about.astro">
  <h1>About &amp; license</h1>
  <p>
    {site.name} is an open-source, community-maintained reference that keeps every Sondors Metacycle on the road: what
    each part is, where to buy it today, and how to fix the common failures. Sondors went out of business, so owners
    depend on each other for parts and service knowledge.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every fact should have a source and a date. Content lives as plain files in a
    <a href={site.repoUrl}>GitHub repository</a> so anyone can fork it. {site.editor} is the editor and reviews every change.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site builds on the community's existing work, especially
    <a href="https://metacyclopedia.github.io/">Metacyclopedia</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>License</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Content (parts data, guides, troubleshooting): <a href={site.license.content.url}>{site.license.content.name}</a>. Reuse and adapt it; changes stay open.</li>
    <li>Code: <a href={site.license.code.url}>{site.license.code.name}</a>.</li>
    <li>Third-party material (manuals, diagrams, photos) keeps its original rights; see the <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
